or-recommends-the-commit-graph.md |   12 +-\n ...ose-git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree.md |  165 +\n ...ose-review-ledger-is-read-once-per-operation.md |    4 +-\n ...e-git-snapshot-budget-scales-with-the-tree.json |   50 +\n .pose/state/components/docs-site.json              |    6 +-\n .pose/state/components/mcp-enforce.json            |    6 +-\n .pose/state/components/pose-mcp.json               |   14 +-\n .pose/state/project-state.md                       |    4 +-\n POSE.md                                            |    2 +-\n locales/pt-BR/POSE.md                              |    2 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor_commit_graph.go       |  117 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/cli/doctor_commit_graph_test.go  |   93 +\n pose-mcp/internal/pose/git_snapshot_budget_test.go |  183 +\n pose-mcp/internal/pose/git_snapshot_integrity.go   |   88 +-\n .../internal/pose/review_adapter_containment.go    |   20 +-\n pose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md            |    2 +-\n .../internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md   |    2 +-\n 76 files changed, 25742 insertions(+), 4564 deletions(-)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
