anged, path)\n\t\t\t\tcontinue\n\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t// Verify executable materialization even when index flags hide it.\n\t\t\t// Windows does not materialize POSIX executable bits.\n\t\t\tif runtime.GOOS != \"windows\" && (info.Mode().Perm()&0111 != 0) != (fields[0] == \"100755\") {\n\t\t\t\tchanged = append(changed, path)\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/locales/pt-BR/POSE.md:1020:Consulte `safety` no run imutável, CLI dispatch/verify/resume e projeção MCP review-bundle existente: profile/platform, capacidades disponíveis/indisponíveis, limites, completude, causa, identificador de runtime e OperationResult B12 de cleanup. Cleanup valida ownership e remove workspace/registro Git exato pelos descritores confinados; nunca faça prune global. Inventários: workspace 100000 entradas e os bytes da árvore do commit em checkout mais 256MiB (no mínimo 256MiB, no máximo 4GiB), registro 1024/256MiB, runtime 4096/128MiB, profundidade 128. Chamadas filesystem dependem de latência de I/O; nenhum deadline absoluto de syscall é alegado. Falha mantém recursos incertos, separada do draft de domínio, devolve erro operacional, bloqueia autoridade/continuação e permanece erro em replay idempotente sem novo spawn. Inspecione o identificador de runtime e seu registro em vez de reexecutar como compensação.\npose-mcp/internal/scaffold/dist/POSE.md:1010:Inspect `safety` on the immutable run, CLI dispatch/verify/resume and the existing MCP review-bundle projection. It reports profile/platform, available/unavailable capabilities, limits, capture completeness, execution cause, runtime resource identifier and the B12 cleanup OperationResult. Cleanup verifies operation ownership and removes only the captured workspace and its exact Git registration through confined descriptors, never a global Git prune. Inventory caps are 100000 workspace entries and the checked-out commit's tree bytes plus 256MiB (at least 256MiB, at most 4GiB), 1024 registration entries/256MiB and 4096 runtime entries/128MiB, depth 128. OS filesystem calls remain subject to I/O latency; no hard syscall deadline is claimed. Failure retains uncertain resources and is separate from the domain draft. It returns an operational error, blocks authority/continuation and remains an error on idempotent replay, without another spawn. Inspect the recorded runtime identifier and registration rather than rerunning the adapter to compensate.\nPOSE.md:1023:Inspect `safety` on the immutable run, CLI dispatch/verify/resume and the existing MCP review-bundle projection. It reports profile/platform, available/unavailable capabilities, limits, capture completeness, execution cause, runtime resource identifier and the B12 cleanup OperationResult. Cleanup verifies operation ownership and removes only the captured workspace and its exact Git registration through confined descriptors, never a global Git prune. Inventory caps are 100000 workspace entries and the checked-out commit's tree bytes plus 256MiB (at least 256MiB, at most 4GiB), 1024 registration entries/256MiB and 4096 runtime entries/128MiB, depth 128. OS filesystem calls remain subject to I/O latency; no hard syscall deadline is claimed. Failure retains uncertain resources and is separate from the domain draft. It returns an operational error, blocks authority/continuation and remains an error on idempotent replay, without another spawn. Inspect the recorded runtime identifier and registration rather than rerunning the adapter to compensate.\nlocales/pt-BR/POSE.md:1020:Consulte `safety` no run imutável, CLI dispatch/verify/resume e projeção MCP review-bundle existente: profile/platform, capacidades disponíveis/indisponíveis, limites, completude, causa, identificador de runtime e OperationResult B12 de cleanup. Cleanup valida ownership e remove workspace/registro Git exato pelos descritores confinados; nunca faça prune global. Inventários: workspace 100000 entradas e os bytes da árvore do commit em checkout mais 256MiB (no mínimo 256MiB, no máximo 4GiB), registro 1024/256MiB, runtime 4096/128MiB, profundidade 128. Chamadas filesystem dependem de latência de I/O; nenhum deadline absoluto de syscall é alegado. Falha mantém recursos incertos, separada do draft de domínio, devolve erro operacional, bloqueia autoridade/continuação e permanece erro em replay idempotente sem novo spawn. Inspecione o identificador de runtime e seu registro em vez de reexecutar como compensação.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_25","type":"agent_message","text":"I found one remaining blocker in the production closeout path: supplying a producer bypasses `listCommittedTree`, so that listing uses a 512 MiB limit and no deadline. This violates R5’s 64 MiB/two-minute bounds. The new regression exercises only calls without a producer, so it misses this path.\n"}}
